# UI Libraries You Should Use

## Foundation

### 1. [shadcn/ui](https://ui.shadcn.com/?utm_source=chatgpt.com)

This should be your base.

Why:

* React
* TypeScript
* Tailwind
* Copy-paste components
* Beautiful defaults
* Industry standard for modern SaaS apps. ([Shadcn UI][1])

Install:

```bash
npx shadcn@latest init
```

---

## Animation Layer

### 2. [Magic UI](https://magicui.design/?utm_source=chatgpt.com)

Use sparingly.

Good for:

* fade-in cards
* number counting animation
* subtle loading states

Avoid fancy landing-page effects.

---

## Inspiration Only

### 3. [Aceternity UI](https://ui.aceternity.com/?utm_source=chatgpt.com)

Excellent source for polished effects and layouts. ([Aceternity UI][2])

But don't build your entire app with it.

Think:

* 90% shadcn
* 10% Aceternity-inspired polish

