# Card Design Rules

## Good

```
🩺 Health Checkup

182 days

since last visit

Due in 3 days

[Mark Done]
```

---

## Bad

```
Health Checkup
Last Event:
2026-01-13T09:24:11
Interval:
180
Remaining:
3
Status:
Pending
```

Never expose raw data.

---

# Color System

Keep it almost monochrome.

| State           | Color |
| --------------- | ----- |
| Normal          | Gray  |
| Upcoming (<10%) | Amber |
| Due             | Red   |
| Completed today | Green |

Example:

```
⚪ Normal

🟡 Due Soon

🔴 Overdue

🟢 Just Completed
```

---

# Typography

Use:

```
Inter
```

or

```
Geist
```

Both are common in modern React apps.

Hierarchy:

```
32px  → days count
16px  → title
14px  → subtitle
12px  → metadata
```

